function adminLogin(){if(EDIT){if(confirm('관리자 모드를 끄까요?')){EDIT=false;alert('관리자 모드가 꺼졌어요.')}closePanel();return}const v=prompt('관리자 비밀번호를 입력하세요');if(v===null)return;if(v===ADMIN_PW){EDIT=true;alert('관리자 모드가 켜졌어요. 이제 ✏ 버튼과 설정 메뉴가 보입니다.');closePanel();openMenu()}else alert('비밀번호가 맞지 않아요.')}
function openMenu(){openPanel('☰ 메뉴',Object.keys(TITLES).filter(k=>EDIT||k!=='edit').map(k=>`<button class="btn" onclick="panelTo('${k}')">${TITLES[k]}</button>`).join(''))}
const bar=(n,v)=>`<div class="card">${esc(n)} · 호감 ${v}/100<div style="height:12px;background:#0008;border:2px solid #fff;margin-top:4px"><div style="height:100%;width:${v}%;background:#f4a6b7"></div></div></div>`;
const pairName=([i,j])=>`${S.chars[i].name} ↔ ${S.chars[j].name}`;
function editForm(){
  const inp=(k,l,t)=>{const v=getP(k)??'';return `<label>${l}</label>`+(t==='a'?`<textarea rows="2" data-k="${k}">${esc(v)}</textarea>`:`<input data-k="${k}" value="${esc(v)}">`)};
  let h='<h3>게임 · 학교</h3>'+GF.map(([k,l,t])=>inp(k,l,t)).join('');
  h+='<h3>시작 · 학교 · 장소 이미지</h3>'+inp('startLabel','START 버튼 글자','i')+'<label>START 버튼 이미지 (선택)</label><input type="file" accept="image/*" data-up="start">'+'<label>학교 정문 이미지 (선택)</label><input type="file" accept="image/*" data-up="school">'+S.locs.map((l,i)=>`<label>${esc(l.n)} 배경 이미지 (선택)</label><input type="file" accept="image/*" data-up="loc${i}">`).join('')+'<h3>장소 정보</h3>'+S.locs.map((l,i)=>inp(`locs.${i}.n`,`장소 ${i+1} 이름`,'i')+inp(`locs.${i}.d`,'장소 설명','a')).join('');
  h+='<h3>캐릭터</h3>'+S.chars.map((c,i)=>`<div class="card"><b>${i?'캐릭터 '+(i+1):'주인공 (1번)'}</b>`+CF.map(([k,l,t])=>inp(`chars.${i}.${k}`,l,t)).join('')+`<label>외모: 머리 / 옷 / 피부 / 눈</label><input type="color" data-k="chars.${i}.hair" value="${c.hair}"><input type="color" data-k="chars.${i}.outfit" value="${c.outfit}"><input type="color" data-k="chars.${i}.skin" value="${c.skin}"><input type="color" data-k="chars.${i}.eye" value="${c.eye||'#2b2233'}"><label>${i?'이미지':'주인공 이미지 1 (기본)'}</label><input type="file" accept="image/*" data-img="${i}">${i?'':'<label>주인공 이미지 2 (1과 번갈아 나옴)</label><input type="file" accept="image/*" data-img2="0">'}<label>기쁨 표정 (호감이 높을 때)</label><input type="file" accept="image/*" data-ex="${i}:happy"><label>부끄러움·당황 표정</label><input type="file" accept="image/*" data-ex="${i}:shy"><label>화남 표정 (호감이 낮을 때)</label><input type="file" accept="image/*" data-ex="${i}:angry">${c.img?'<label>✔ 이미지 적용됨</label>':''}</div>`).join('');
  return h;
}
function panelTo(k){if(k==='admin'){adminLogin();return}if(k==='edit'&&!EDIT)return;
  let h='';
  if(k==='dex')h=S.chars.map((c,i)=>`<div class="card"><canvas data-i="${i}" width="64" height="80" style="float:left;margin-right:10px;width:64px;height:80px;background:#fff2"></canvas><b>${esc(c.name)}</b> ${i?'· 주인공과 호감 '+G.aff[0][i]:'· 주인공'}<br>${esc(c.age)} ${esc(c.grade)}<br>${esc(c.intro)}<br><small>말투: ${esc(c.speech)}</small></div>`).join('');
  if(k==='school')h=`<div class="card"><b>${esc(S.school.name)}</b><br>${esc(S.school.intro)}</div>`+[['history','학교의 역사'],['atmos','분위기'],['rules','교칙'],['cautions','주의사항'],['grades','학년 및 반'],['special','특별실'],['clubs','동아리'],['council','학생회'],['teachers','선생님']].map(([x,l])=>`<div class="card"><b>${l}</b><br>${esc(S.school[x]).replace(/\n/g,'<br>')}</div>`).join('')+'<h3>장소</h3>'+S.locs.map(l=>`<div class="card"><b>${esc(l.n)}</b><br>${esc(l.d)}</div>`).join('');
  if(k==='mission')h=`<div class="card">${esc(S.mission)}<br><br>${esc(S.fail)}<br><br>남은 턴 <b>${G.turn}</b> / ${S.maxTurn}</div>`+PAIRS.map(p=>bar(pairName(p),G.aff[p[0]][p[1]])).join('');
  if(k==='rel')h=PAIRS.map(p=>bar(pairName(p),G.aff[p[0]][p[1]])).join('')+`<div class="card">${esc(S.rel).replace(/\n/g,'<br>')||'설정 → 캐릭터 간 관계 메모에서 입력하세요.'}</div>`;
  if(k==='save')h=`<div class="card">진행 상황을 저장하거나 불러옵니다. 설정은 자동으로 브라우저에 저장됩니다.</div><button class="btn" onclick="saveG()">💾 저장</button><button class="btn" onclick="loadG()">📂 불러오기</button><button class="btn" onclick="restart()">↺ 새 게임</button>`;
  if(k==='edit')h=editForm()+`<button class="btn" onclick="applySettings()">💾 적용 및 저장</button><button class="btn" onclick="resetS()">기본값 복원</button>`;
  openPanel(TITLES[k],h);
  if(k==='dex')document.querySelectorAll('#panel canvas[data-i]').forEach(cv=>{const x=cv.getContext('2d');x.imageSmoothingEnabled=false;sprite(x,+cv.dataset.i,32,76,3)});
}
function applySettings(){
  document.querySelectorAll('#panel [data-k]').forEach(el=>{let v=el.value;if(el.dataset.k==='maxTurn')v=parseInt(v)||60;setP(el.dataset.k,v)});
  saveNow();loadImgs();$('ttl').textContent=S.title;applyStart();drawGate();drawStage();
  alert('저장되었습니다. 새로고침해도 유지됩니다.');
}
function resetS(){if(confirm('설정을 기본값으로 되돌릴까요?')){localStorage.removeItem(KEY);location.reload()}}
$('panel').addEventListener('change',e=>{
  const el=e.target;if(el.dataset.img==null||!el.files[0])return;const i=+el.dataset.img;
  const r=new FileReader();r.onload=()=>{const im=new Image();im.onload=()=>{
    const cv=document.createElement('canvas');cv.width=128;cv.height=160;const x=cv.getContext('2d');
    const sw=im.width*.34,sh=im.height*.62,k=Math.min(128/sw,160/sh);
    x.drawImage(im,0,0,sw,sh,(128-sw*k)/2,(160-sh*k)/2,sw*k,sh*k);
    S.chars[i].img=cv.toDataURL('image/png');loadImgs();alert('이미지가 적용되었습니다. 저장을 눌러 유지하세요.');
  };im.src=r.result};r.readAsDataURL(el.files[0]);
});

function cropChar(im){const cv=document.createElement('canvas');cv.width=128;cv.height=160;const x=cv.getContext('2d');const sw=im.width*.34,sh=im.height*.62,k=Math.min(128/sw,160/sh);x.drawImage(im,0,0,sw,sh,(128-sw*k)/2,(160-sh*k)/2,sw*k,sh*k);return cv.toDataURL('image/png')}
function fitImg(im,max){const k=Math.min(1,max/Math.max(im.width,im.height));const cv=document.createElement('canvas');cv.width=Math.round(im.width*k);cv.height=Math.round(im.height*k);cv.getContext('2d').drawImage(im,0,0,cv.width,cv.height);return cv.toDataURL('image/jpeg',.85)}
function saveNow(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(S))}catch(e){alert('저장 공간이 부족합니다. 이미지를 조금 줄여 주세요.')}}
$('panel').addEventListener('change',e=>{
  const el=e.target,f=el.files&&el.files[0];if(!f)return;
  const up=el.dataset.up,f2=el.dataset.img2!=null,ex=el.dataset.ex;if(!up&&!f2&&!ex)return;
  const r=new FileReader();r.onload=()=>{const im=new Image();im.onload=()=>{
    if(ex){const[ci,k]=ex.split(':');S.chars[+ci].ex=S.chars[+ci].ex||{};S.chars[+ci].ex[k]=cropChar(im)}
    else if(f2)S.chars[0].img2=cropChar(im);
    else if(up==='start')S.startImg=fitImg(im,400);
    else if(up==='school')S.school.img=fitImg(im,600);
    else S.locs[+up.slice(3)].img=fitImg(im,600);
    saveNow();applyStart();drawGate();drawStage();alert('이미지가 적용되었습니다.');
  };im.src=r.result};r.readAsDataURL(f);
});
/* ---------- save / load ---------- */
function saveG(){localStorage.setItem(SKEY,JSON.stringify(G));alert('저장되었습니다.')}
function loadG(){const v=localStorage.getItem(SKEY);if(!v)return alert('저장된 데이터가 없습니다.');G=JSON.parse(v);closePanel();flash(()=>{show('main');updHud();base('저장한 지점에서 다시 시작합니다.')})}
function restart(){G=newG();closePanel();flash(()=>{show('main');startAwake()})}

/* ---------- init ---------- */
$('ttl').textContent=S.title;loadImgs();drawGate();applyStart();
$('sea').addEventListener('pointerdown',()=>{ambient();$('hint').style.display='none'});
const BGM={on:false,g:null,t:0,i:0};
const CHORDS=[[261.6,329.6,392],[220,261.6,329.6],[174.6,220,261.6],[196,246.9,293.7]];
const MEL=[659.3,0,784,659.3,0,587.3,0,523.3,587.3,0,659.3,0,523.3,0,0,0];
function tone(f,t,d,type,vol,dst){const a=ac(),o=a.createOscillator(),g=a.createGain();o.type=type;o.frequency.value=f;g.gain.setValueAtTime(0,t);g.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(vol,t+.04);g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.001,t+d);o.connect(g);g.connect(dst);o.start(t);o.stop(t+d+.05)}
function bgmStart(){
  if(BGM.on)return;BGM.on=true;const a=ac();
  BGM.g=a.createGain();BGM.g.gain.value=0;BGM.g.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(.5,a.currentTime+2);BGM.g.connect(a.destination);
  BGM.t=a.currentTime+.1;BGM.i=0;
  setInterval(()=>{const now=ac().currentTime;while(BGM.t<now+.6){const step=BGM.i%16,bar=Math.floor(BGM.i/4)%4;if(step%4===0)CHORDS[bar].forEach(f=>tone(f,BGM.t,1.9,'sine',.05,BGM.g));if(MEL[step])tone(MEL[step],BGM.t,.5,'triangle',.12,BGM.g);BGM.t+=.25;BGM.i++}},150);
}
function seaFade(){if(ambG){ambG.gain.setTargetAtTime(0,ac().currentTime,.4)}}
$('startBtn').onclick=()=>{sfx(880);seaFade();bgmStart();go('gate',drawGate)};
$('enterBtn').onclick=()=>{sfx(660);go('main',startAwake)};
$('menuBtn').onclick=openMenu;
setTimeout(()=>$('startBtn').style.opacity=1,1500);
setInterval(()=>{if($('main').classList.contains('on'))drawStage()},130);
requestAnimationFrame(drawSea);
</script></body></html>
